<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>Can a non-engineering graduate really become a developer? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes, and our batches prove it every cohort. The course assumes zero coding and builds logic first. What decides success is daily practice, and the structure keeps you practising.</div></details>
<details><summary>Why Python and React specifically? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Because that is what the job market asks for. Python plus Django on the backend and React on the frontend appear in more Kerala and Bengaluru postings than any other combination for junior roles.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will AI coding tools make junior developers obsolete? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">They make untrained juniors obsolete. Teams now expect juniors who can direct AI, review its output and own the result. We teach AI pair-programming as a discipline, which makes you more employable, not less.</div></details>
<details><summary>What is the starting salary for a full stack developer? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Freshers typically start between Rs 3.5 and 6.5 lakh. With two to three years of real shipping, Rs 7 to 14 lakh is common, and strong seniors earn well beyond that.</div></details>
<details><summary>How much time do I need each week? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Around 10 hours: live sessions plus daily practice. Six months, roughly 244 hours, 10 modules, three deployed capstones. Coding is a practice skill; the schedule protects that.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do I get real projects for my resume? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">You graduate with three deployed applications on live URLs plus a GitHub profile with a real commit history. Recruiters can click and verify everything.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
